# Guns and gear. The rifle is in starter.items.
# Guns: the player has three weapon slots (keys 1, 2, 3; the mouse wheel or Q
# switches too). A gun found while all three are full goes into the bag: pick it
# in the inventory (I) and Use to swap it with the gun in hand. "draw" is how
# long a gun takes to come up. Gear: pick it in the inventory and Use to wear
# it -- what it replaces goes back into the bag. "resist.physical" is the share
# of the creatures' damage it takes off. Grenades: G throws one (it arcs; aim up to throw it far)
# ("casts" an ability when used).

weapon pistol
  name Pistol
  fire semi
  damage 24 kinetic
  rpm 400
  magazine 12
  reload 1.2
  draw 0.25
  spread 0.4
  bloom 0.6 3 8
  recoil 0.9 0.2
  aim 0.85 0.4 0.1
  range 80
  impact 0.08
  flash
  ammo pistol_rounds
  model assets/models/military/weapons/pistol.glb
  view 0.13 -0.16 0.42 -4 2 0
  grip weapon_socket 0 0 0 90 0 180
  hold pistol
end

